le></rect><rect x="777.5" y="106" width="35.6" height="26" rx="3" fill="#c2410c" opacity="0.47"><title>Indi Gupte, 12:00 UTC: 5</title></rect><rect x="814.6" y="106" width="35.6" height="26" rx="3" fill="#c2410c" opacity="0.29"><title>Indi Gupte, 13:00 UTC: 1</title></rect><rect x="851.7" y="117" width="35.6" height="4" rx="2" class="nil"/><rect x="888.8" y="106" width="35.6" height="26" rx="3" fill="#c2410c" opacity="0.47"><title>Indi Gupte, 15:00 UTC: 5</title></rect><rect x="925.8" y="106" width="35.6" height="26" rx="3" fill="#c2410c" opacity="0.34"><title>Indi Gupte, 16:00 UTC: 2</title></rect><rect x="962.9" y="106" width="35.6" height="26" rx="3" fill="#c2410c" opacity="0.29"><title>Indi Gupte, 17:00 UTC: 1</title></rect><text x="0" y="158" class="hl">Angelo</text><rect x="110.0" y="140" width="35.6" height="26" rx="3" fill="#15803d" opacity="0.34"><title>Angelo, 18:00 UTC: 2</title></rect><rect x="147.1" y="140" width="35.6" height="26" rx="3" fill="#15803d" opacity="0.29"><title>Angelo, 19:00 UTC: 1</title></rect><rect x="184.2" y="151" width="35.6" height="4" rx="2" class="nil"/><rect x="221.2" y="151" width="35.6" height="4" rx="2" class="nil"/><rect x="258.3" y="151" width="35.6" height="4" rx="2" class="nil"/><rect x="295.4" y="151" width="35.6" height="4" rx="2" class="nil"/><rect x="332.5" y="151" width="35.6" height="4" rx="2" class="nil"/><rect x="369.6" y="151" width="35.6" height="4" rx="2" class="nil"/><rect x="406.7" y="151" width="35.6" height="4" rx="2" class="nil"/><rect x="443.8" y="151" width="35.6" height="4" rx="2" class="nil"/><rect x="480.8" y="151" width="35.6" height="4" rx="2" class="nil"/><rect x="517.9" y="151" width="35.6" height="4" rx="2" class="nil"/><rect x="555.0" y="151" width="35.6" height="4" rx="2" class="nil"/><rect x="592.1" y="140" width="35.6" height="26" rx="3" fill="#15803d" opacity="0.34"><title>Angelo, 07:00 UTC: 2</title></rect><rect x="629.2" y="151" width="35.6" height="4" rx="2" class="nil"/><rect x="666.2" y="140" width="35.6" height="26" rx="3" fill="#15803d" opacity="0.29"><title>Angelo, 09:00 UTC: 1</title></rect><rect x="703.3" y="140" width="35.6" height="26" rx="3" fill="#15803d" opacity="0.38"><title>Angelo, 10:00 UTC: 3</title></rect><rect x="740.4" y="151" width="35.6" height="4" rx="2" class="nil"/><rect x="777.5" y="140" width="35.6" height="26" rx="3" fill="#15803d" opacity="0.43"><title>Angelo, 12:00 UTC: 4</title></rect><rect x="814.6" y="140" width="35.6" height="26" rx="3" fill="#15803d" opacity="0.34"><title>Angelo, 13:00 UTC: 2</title></rect><rect x="851.7" y="151" width="35.6" height="4" rx="2" class="nil"/><rect x="888.8" y="140" width="35.6" height="26" rx="3" fill="#15803d" opacity="0.29"><title>Angelo, 15:00 UTC: 1</title></rect><rect x="925.8" y="140" width="35.6" height="26" rx="3" fill="#15803d" opacity="0.47"><title>Angelo, 16:00 UTC: 5</title></rect><rect x="962.9" y="151" width="35.6" height="4" rx="2" class="nil"/><text x="0" y="192" class="hl">Silvio</text><rect x="110.0" y="185" width="35.6" height="4" rx="2" class="nil"/><rect x="147.1" y="185" width="35.6" height="4" rx="2" class="nil"/><rect x="184.2" y="185" width="35.6" height="4" rx="2" class="nil"/><rect x="221.2" y="174" width="35.6" height="26" rx="3" fill="#b91c1c" opacity="0.29"><title>Silvio Switha, 21:00 UTC: 1</title></rect><rect x="258.3" y="185" width="35.6" height="4" rx="2" class="nil"/><rect x="295.4" y="185" width="35.6" height="4" rx="2" class="nil"/><rect x="332.5" y="185" width="35.6" height="4" rx="2" class="nil"/><rect x="369.6" y="185" width="35.6" height="4" rx="2" class="nil"/><rect x="406.7" y="174" width="35.6" height="26" rx="3" fill="#b91c1c" opacity="0.29"><title>Silvio Switha, 02:00 UTC: 1</title></rect><rect x="443.8" y="185" width="35.6" height="4" rx="2" class="nil"/><rect x="480.8" y="185" width="35.6" height="4" rx="2" class="nil"/><rect x="517.9" y="185" width="35.6" height="4" rx="2" class="nil"/><rect x="555.0" y="185" width="35.6" height="4" rx="2" class="nil"/><rect x="592.1" y="174" width="35.6" height="26" rx="3" fill="#b91c1c" opacity="0.29"><title>Silvio Switha, 07:00 UTC: 1</title></rect><rect x="629.2" y="185" width="35.6" height="4" rx="2" class="nil"/><rect x="666.2" y="185" width="35.6" height="4" rx="2" class="nil"/><rect x="703.3" y="174" width="35.6" height="26" rx="3" fill="#b91c1c" opacity="0.29"><title>Silvio Switha, 10:00 UTC: 1</title></rect><rect x="740.4" y="185" width="35.6" height="4" rx="2" class="nil"/><rect x="777.5" y="174" width="35.6" height="26" rx="3" fill="#b91c1c" opacity="0.29"><title>Silvio Switha, 12:00 UTC: 1</title></rect><rect x="814.6" y="174" width="35.6" height="26" rx="3" fill="#b91c1c" opacity="0.34"><title>Silvio Switha, 13:00 UTC: 2</title></rect><rect x="851.7" y="174" width="35.6" height="26" rx="3" fill="#b91c1c" opacity="0.38"><title>Silvio Switha, 14:00 UTC: 3</title></rect><rect x="888.8" y="185" width="35.6" height="4" rx="2" class="nil"/><rect x="925.8" y="174" width="35.6" height="26" rx="3" fill="#b91c1c" opacity="0.29"><title>Silvio Switha, 16:00 UTC: 1</title></rect><rect x="962.9" y="174" width="35.6" height="26" rx="3" fill="#b91c1c" opacity="0.38"><title>Silvio Switha, 17:00 UTC: 3</title></rect><text x="110.0" y="224" class="hx">03 Nov 18:00</text><text x="332.5" y="224" class="hx">04 Nov 00:00</text><text x="555.0" y="224" class="hx">04 Nov 06:00</text><text x="777.5" y="224" class="hx">04 Nov 12:00</text></svg><p class="cap">The night is not empty: Indi's factory at 23:00, Jose's agents from 23:40 to 02:00, Dinis's journalist every two hours. Each square is an hour; darker is more.</p></section><section class="slide" aria-label="The agents"><h2>34 agents did work today; 35 keys on the keys page</h2><div class="dotrow"><span>Dinis</span><span class="ds"><i style="background:#111827" title="abp@web-summit.dinis"></i><i style="background:#111827" title="conductor@web-summit.dinis"></i><i style="background:#111827" title="dashboard@web-summit.dinis"></i><i style="background:#111827" title="designer@web-summit.dinis"></i><i style="background:#111827" title="dev@web-summit.dinis"></i><i style="background:#111827" title="journalist@web-summit.dinis"></i><i style="background:#111827" title="mentor@web-summit.dinis"></i><i style="background:#111827" title="project-manager@web-summit.dinis"></i><i style="background:#111827" title="pulse@web-summit.dinis"></i><i style="background:#111827" title="security@web-summit.dinis"></i><i style="background:#111827" title="sgit@web-summit.dinis"></i></span><em>11: abp, conductor, dashboard, designer, dev, journalist, mentor, project-manager, pulse, security, sgit</em></div><div class="dotrow"><span>Vicky</span><span class="ds"><i style="background:#7c3aed" title="conductor@web-summit.vicky"></i><i style="background:#7c3aed" title="dashboard@web-summit.vicky"></i><i style="background:#7c3aed" title="dev@web-summit.vicky"></i><i style="background:#7c3aed" title="logistics@web-summit.vicky"></i><i style="background:#7c3aed" title="pm@web-summit.vicky"></i><i style="background:#7c3aed" title="researcher@web-summit.vicky"></i><i style="background:#7c3aed" title="vault@web-summit.vicky"></i></span><em>7: conductor, dashboard, dev, logistics, pm, researcher, vault</em></div><div class="dotrow"><span>Jose</span><span class="ds"><i style="background:#0e7490" title="conductor@web-summit.jose"></i><i style="background:#0e7490" title="dashboard@web-summit.jose"></i><i style="background:#0e7490" title="dev@web-summit.jose"></i><i style="background:#0e7490" title="vault@web-summit.jose"></i><i style="background:#0e7490" title="watcher@web-summit.jose"></i></span><em>5: conductor, dashboard, dev, vault, watcher</em></div><div class="dotrow"><span>Indi</span><span class="ds"><i style="background:#c2410c" title="conductor@web-summit.indi"></i><i style="background:#c2410c" title="dashboard@web-summit.indi"></i><i style="background:#c2410c" title="designer@web-summit.indi"></i><i style="background:#c2410c" title="dev@web-summit.indi"></i><i style="background:#c2410c" title="synthetic@web-summit.indi"></i></span><em>5: conductor, dashboard, designer, dev, synthetic</em></div><div class="dotrow"><span>Angelo</span><span class="ds"><i style="background:#15803d" title="conductor@web-summit.angelo"></i><i style="background:#15803d" title="dashboard@web-summit.angelo"></i><i style="background:#15803d" title="dev@web-summit.angelo"></i><i style="background:#15803d" title="team-collaboration@web-summit.angelo"></i></span><em>4: conductor, dashboard, dev, team-collaboration</em></div><div class="dotrow"><span>Silvio</span><span class="ds"><i style="background:#b91c1c" title="conductor@web-summit.silvio"></i><i style="background:#b91c1c" title="procurement@web-summit.silvio"></i></span><em>2: conductor, procurement</em></div><p class="cap">One dot per agent that committed under its own name since yesterday 18:00.</p></section><section class="slide" aria-label="Since the 14:30 stand-up"><h2>Since the 14:30 stand-up</h2><div class="bars"><div class="b"><span>Dinis</span><i style="width:100%;background:#111827"></i><b>18</b></div><div class="b"><span>Vicky</span><i style="width:56%;background:#7c3aed"></i><b>10</b></div><div class="b"><span>Indi</span><i style="width:44%;background:#c2410c"></i><b>8</b></div><div class="b"><span>Angelo</span><i style="width:33%;background:#15803d"></i><b>6</b></div><div class="b"><span>Silvio</span><i style="width:22%;background:#b91c1c"></i><b>4</b></div><div class="b"><span>Jose</span><i style="width:17%;background:#0e7490"></i><b>3</b></div></div><p class="cap">Commits since 14:30, by person (their agents).</p><ul><li><b>Jose</b>: the team site now sends its page views (WS-37): two vaults, five lanes, an hourly drain; a view signed with his key verified</li><li><b>Silvio</b>: the merch is <b>ordered</b>; the sleeve logo confirmed by Dinis in person; Vicky's colours settled</li><li><b>Vicky</b>: the newsroom's two vaults exist; her researcher's second run; the outreach plan from her meeting with Nimay</li><li><b>Indi</b>: synthetic users re-tested the cards and the /meet/ pages; the most important thing each person did, on every show page (WS-149); an accountant agent (WS-148)</li><li><b>Angelo</b>: his own command centre, a kanban and a "team and the machine" board</li><li><b>Dinis's agents</b>: the observability pack; incident WS-151 found and fixed ("Only you can do this" first)</li></ul></section><section class="slide" aria-label="Indi"><h2>Indi: the factory, overnight</h2><div class="two"><figure class="shot"><img src="../../../assets/shows/2026-11-04-1800/indi-factory-index.jpg" alt="The factory: one infographic per company" loading="lazy"><figcaption>The factory: one infographic per company</figcaption></figure><figure class="shot"><img src="../../../assets/shows/2026-11-04-1800/indi-factory.jpg" alt="Hexamind, one of 28 companies, in normal and lay terms" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Hexamind, one of 28 companies, in normal and lay terms</figcaption></figure></div><ul><li><b>35 commits</b> from <b>5 agents</b> (conductor, dashboard, designer, dev, synthetic), the first on schedule overnight</li><li><b>The factory</b> (dev@indi, 23:00 to 23:14): an infographic for <b>all 28 companies</b> we want to meet: what it does, its risk from agents, how RiskMandate helps</li><li><b>Business cards</b>: three concepts, six round-2 designs, tested by synthetic users (Record picked by 4 of 5)</li><li><b>The newsroom</b>: a review of the three earlier newsrooms and a patch that makes ours a publication (WS-141)</li></ul></section><section class="slide" aria-label="Indi: cards and tests"><h2>Indi: the cards, and agents that test like users</h2><div class="two"><figure class="shot"><img src="../../../assets/shows/2026-11-04-1800/indi-cards.jpg" alt="/cards/: the designs, one at a time, for a phone" loading="lazy"><figcaption>/cards/: the designs, one at a time, for a phone</figcaption></figure><figure class="shot"><img src="../../../assets/shows/2026-11-04-1800/indi-dash.jpg" alt="Indi&#x27;s dashboard" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Indi&#x27;s dashboard</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class="slide" aria-label="Vicky"><h2>Vicky: 54 commits from 7 agents</h2><div class="two"><figure class="shot"><img src="../../../assets/shows/2026-11-04-1800/vicky-guide.jpg" alt="The plain-language onboarding guide (WS-100)" loading="lazy"><figcaption>The plain-language onboarding guide (WS-100)</figcaption></figure><figure class="shot"><img src="../../../assets/shows/2026-11-04-1800/vicky-dash.jpg" alt="Vicky&#x27;s dashboard" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Vicky&#x27;s dashboard</figcaption></figure></div><ul><li><b>The onboarding guide</b>, written from her own setup: steps 1 to 9, exact button names (pm@vicky)</li><li><b>The newsroom</b>: her researcher's first runs (19 captures on the summit and Portugal, then Europe and the Gender in Tech report); the research vault (pack mode) and the interview shortlist vault</li><li><b>Logistics</b>: the print date, who collects, her colours; <b>one report a day</b> from every agent to her conductor</li><li><b>Outreach</b>: the plan from her meeting with Nimay; the hot-leads rule drafted</li></ul></section><section class="slide" aria-label="Jose"><h2>Jose: observability, live in an afternoon</h2><div class="two"><figure class="shot"><img src="../../../assets/shows/2026-11-04-1800/jose-dash.jpg" alt="Jose&#x27;s dashboard" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Jose&#x27;s dashboard</figcaption></figure><figure class="shot"><img src="../../../assets/shows/2026-11-04-1800/keys.jpg" alt="The keys page: every agent&#x27;s public key" loading="lazy"><figcaption>The keys page: every agent&#x27;s public key</figcaption></figure></div><ul><li><b>The team site sends its page views</b> (17:08): two vaults (data, private; the app, published), <b>five lanes</b>, an hourly drain and one from inside the vault</li><li>A page view sent <b>with Jose's site key</b> was verified as Jose: the first signed visit</li><li><b>A reviewer agent</b> that holds his conductor's and dashboard's work until it is right (two wrong claims caught)</li><li><b>Hack the Agent</b> and <b>ReachCheck</b> offered as stand demos (WS-108); WhatsApp reports through n8n (WS-39)</li></ul></section><section class="slide" aria-label="Angelo"><h2>Angelo: his own command centre</h2><div class="two"><figure class="shot"><img src="../../../assets/shows/2026-11-04-1800/angelo-kanban.jpg" alt="Angelo&#x27;s team board: the kanban" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Angelo&#x27;s team board: the kanban</figcaption></figure><figure class="shot"><img src="../../../assets/shows/2026-11-04-1800/angelo-app.jpg" alt="Angelo&#x27;s command centre, extended, not copied" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Angelo&#x27;s command centre, extended, not copied</figcaption></figure></div><ul><li><b>Slices 0 to 5</b> of his command centre: the kanban, filters, bookmarkable views, people and agents and the machine</li><li><b>team-collaboration@angelo</b> moved today's stand-up and keeps the debriefs (it still needs the transcript)</li><li>The technical parts of the onboarding guide; <b>Give feedback</b> in one click (WS-140)</li></ul></section><section class="slide" aria-label="Silvio"><h2>Silvio: the merch is ordered</h2><div class="two"><figure class="shot"><img src="../../../assets/shows/2026-11-04-1800/print-next.jpg" alt="/print/: the next set (generic QR, the RiskMandate mark)" loading="lazy"><figcaption>/print/: the next set (generic QR, the RiskMandate mark)</figcaption></figure><figure class="shot"><img src="../../../assets/shows/2026-11-04-1800/home.jpg" alt="The home page" loading="lazy"><figcaption>The home page</figcaption></figure></div><ul><li><b>Ordered</b> with the chosen printer; layouts and invoice on Thursday; collection asked for Monday 9 Nov</li><li>The sleeves carry the RiskMandate logo (Silvio's choice, Dinis's word in person, 17:03)</li><li>Vicky's purple T-shirts and lavender hoodie; a printer that declined publication recorded as no</li></ul></section><section class="slide" aria-label="Dinis&#x27;s agents"><h2>Dinis's agents: 80 commits from 11 agents</h2><div class="two"><figure class="shot"><img src="../../../assets/shows/2026-11-04-1800/newsroom-brief.jpg" alt="The newsroom&#x27;s brief pack: Dinis&#x27;s vision, verbatim, and nine pages" loading="lazy"><figcaption>The newsroom&#x27;s brief pack: Dinis&#x27;s vision, verbatim, and nine pages</figcaption></figure><figure class="shot"><img src="../../../assets/shows/2026-11-04-1800/dinis-app.jpg" alt="Dinis&#x27;s command centre" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Dinis&#x27;s command centre</figcaption></figure></div><ul><li><b>The newsroom</b>: the brief pack live; the newsroom agent's site; Indi's and Vicky's desks starting</li><li><b>Keys flying</b>: five people with keys, signed messages verified, the big "Add your key" on every page</li><li><b>The observability pack</b> (from the PHP site's vaults), picked up by Jose within the hour</li><li><b>Incident WS-151</b>: why WS-145 was buried; found, fixed, "Only you can do this" first</li></ul></section><section class="slide" aria-label="Keys"><h2>Keys: who can be known by the site</h2><div class="keys"><div class="k on" style="--c:#111827"><b>Dinis</b><span>key issued</span></div><div class="k " style="--c:#b91c1c"><b>Silvio</b><span>no key yet</span></div><div class="k " style="--c:#1d4ed8"><b>Nimay</b><span>no key yet</span></div><div class="k on" style="--c:#15803d"><b>Angelo</b><span>key issued</span></div><div class="k on" style="--c:#7c3aed"><b>Vicky</b><span>key issued</span></div><div class="k on" style="--c:#c2410c"><b>Indi</b><span>key issued</span></div><div class="k on" style="--c:#0e7490"><b>Jose</b><span>key issued</span></div></div><p class="cap">WS-136. Next: Silvio and Nimay. Then the vault-to-vault lanes (WS-120), and signed page views for everyone (WS-37).</p></section><section class="slide" aria-label="The 14:30, looked back"><h2>The 14:30 stand-up: what we know came out of it</h2><ul><li><b>Settled since, outside the call</b>: the merch ordered (Silvio); the sleeve logo (Dinis, in person); Vicky's colours; the generic QR accepted by Dinis (in chat) and the next print set ready on /print/#next</li><li><b>Not on the record</b>: no decision from the 14:30 was written down; team-collaboration@angelo still waits for the transcript (WS-96, WS-107)</li><li><b>Asked of Dinis and still open</b>: Indi's write access to the newsroom (WS-145), Indi's patch and the desks split (WS-141); protect main (WS-105)</li><li><b>Raised by Dinis after it</b>: briefs as pages with "I have read this", a RACI per person, observability for people and agents (now live for the site)</li></ul></section><section class="slide" aria-label="RACI, a first cut"><h2>RACI, a first cut for Dinis to mark up</h2><table class="raci"><tr><th>Workstream</th><th>Dinis</th><th>Silvio</th><th>Nimay</th><th>Angelo</th><th>Vicky</th><th>Jose</th><th>Indi</th></tr><tr><td>The newsroom</td><td class="rA">A</td><td class="rI">I</td><td class="rC">C</td><td class="rI">I</td><td class="rR">R</td><td class="rI">I</td><td class="rR">R</td></tr><tr><td>Merch and print</td><td class="rA">A</td><td class="rR">R</td><td class="rI">I</td><td class="rI">I</td><td class="rC">C</td><td class="rI">I</td><td class="rC">C</td></tr><tr><td>Observability</td><td class="rA">A</td><td class="rI">I</td><td class="rI">I</td><td class="rC">C</td><td class="rI">I</td><td class="rR">R</td><td class="rI">I</td></tr><tr><td>Keys and identity</td><td class="rA">A</td><td class="rR">R</td><td class="rR">R</td><td class="rR">R</td><td class="rR">R</td><td class="rR">R</td><td class="rR">R</td></tr><tr><td>Outreach: the first five, the message</td><td class="rC">C</td><td class="rR">R</td><td class="rA">A</td><td class="rI">I</td><td class="rR">R</td><td class="rI">I</td><td class="rC">C</td></tr><tr><td>The site and the home page</td><td class="rA">A</td><td class="rI">I</td><td class="rI">I</td><td class="rR">R</td><td class="rI">I</td><td class="rC">C</td><td class="rC">C</td></tr><tr><td>Stand-ups and decisions</td><td class="rA">A</td><td class="rI">I</td><td class="rI">I</td><td class="rR">R</td><td class="rC">C</td><td class="rI">I</td><td class="rI">I</td></tr><tr><td>Onboarding (the guide)</td><td class="rI">I</td><td class="rI">I</td><td class="rI">I</td><td class="rC">C</td><td class="rA">A</td><td class="rI">I</td><td class="rC">C</td></tr></table><p class="cap"><b>R</b> does it · <b>A</b> answers for it (one per row) · <b>C</b> is asked first · <b>I</b> is told. Each person's dashboard will lead with their A and R rows.</p></section><section class="slide" aria-label="To decide now"><h2>To decide at this stand-up</h2><ol class="decide"><li><b>The RACI</b>: accept the first cut, or mark it up now</li><li><b>The newsroom</b>: write access for Indi (WS-145) and Vicky; apply Indi's patch; the desks split (WS-141)</li><li><b>Observability</b>: a public vault for the team's reads (per person), counts only for everyone else; who sees /stats/</li><li><b>Print</b>: the next set on /print/#next (generic QR, the RiskMandate mark, Vicky Wang): yes; who collects on Monday</li><li><b>WS-151</b>: "Only you can do this" first on Dinis's dashboard, and on everyone's</li><li><b>Who records the decisions</b> (WS-107): team-collaboration@angelo drafts, the chair confirms (Vicky's choice)</li></ol></section><section class="slide" aria-label="Follow-ups"><h2>Follow-ups, each with an owner</h2><ul><li><b>Silvio and Nimay</b>: add their site keys tonight (their conductors issue them)</li><li><b>Jose</b>: /stats/ with the team's reads; the agent lane (every agent logs what it read and did)</li><li><b>Indi and Vicky</b>: the newsroom's first desks running from its brief pack; three articles by Saturday</li><li><b>The designer</b>: the print set's re-signs as soon as Dinis says yes on /print/#next</li><li><b>Dinis's conductor</b>: briefs as pages with "I have read this"; the RACI on every dashboard; this deck before every stand-up</li></ul></section></div>
